  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions: random_walk in clear, rotate_clockwise for front/left obstacles, rotate_counterclockwise for right obstacles, and full_rotate only as a last-resort escape. The design ensures conservative recovery, avoids oscillation, and prioritizes coverage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and motion into distinct plant automata for clarity and modularity.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe, progress-maximizing exploration: random_walk in clear, short turns for obstacle recovery, and full_rotate only after repeated blockages."
